        <briefdescription>
<para>Handle any <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_d_i_e" kindref="compound">DIE</ref> (debug info entry) from the DWARF. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function will find all DW_TAG_subprogram DIEs that convert them into GSYM FuntionInfo objects and add them to the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1gsym_1_1_gsym_creator" kindref="compound">GsymCreator</ref> supplied during construction. The <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_d_i_e" kindref="compound">DIE</ref> and all its children will be recursively parsed with calls to this function.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Strm</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The thread specific log stream for any non fatal errors and warnings. Once a thread has finished parsing an entire compile unit, all information in this temporary stream will be forwarded to the member variable log. This keeps logging thread safe. If the value is NULL, then don&apos;t log.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>CUI</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The compile unit specific information that contains the DWARF line table, cached file list, and other compile unit specific information.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Die</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The DWARF debug info entry to parse. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
