    <briefdescription>
<para>A class that transforms the DWARF in a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_d_w_a_r_f_context" kindref="compound">DWARFContext</ref> into GSYM information by populating the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1gsym_1_1_gsym_creator" kindref="compound">GsymCreator</ref> object that it is constructed with. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class supports converting all DW_TAG_subprogram DIEs into <ref refid="structllvm_1_1gsym_1_1_function_info" kindref="compound">gsym::FunctionInfo</ref> objects that includes line table information and inline function information. Creating a separate class to transform this data allows this class to be unit tested. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
